### 1. Conectar ao Stream SSE do MCP
GET http://localhost:8091/mcp/sse
Accept: text/event-stream

### 2. Enviar Inicialização JSON-RPC (Substitua o sessionId gerado no passo 1)
POST http://localhost:8091/mcp/message?sessionId=SEU_SESSION_ID_AQUI
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "jsonrpc": "2.0",
  "id": 1,
  "method": "initialize",
  "params": {
    "protocolVersion": "2024-11-05",
    "capabilities": {},
    "clientInfo": {
      "name": "intellij-http-client",
      "version": "1.0.0"
    }
  }
}

### 3. Listar Ferramentas do Objetos-MCP
POST http://localhost:8091/mcp/message?sessionId=SEU_SESSION_ID_AQUI
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "jsonrpc": "2.0",
  "id": 2,
  "method": "tools/list"
}